More Delight
------------
Data, assets and item values are carried or adapted from More Delight
(https://github.com/axperty/moredelight, branch 26.3-fabric, commit
360e61172756e8b22d4d647753321002c7452d35, version 26.09.16-26.3-fabric),
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 Axperty; its LICENSE also carries Farmer's
Delight's MIT notice, Copyright (c) 2020 vectorwing. Full text:
LICENSE-moredelight (also third_party/moredelight/LICENSE).

Item behaviour follows DelightLib (https://github.com/axperty/delightlib,
commit f0017bf3f4d1b541fb20e3cf3399c1a87c7061e2, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026
Axperty), read as a reference; nothing from it is shipped.

Farmer's Delight
----------------
This add-on needs the Farmer's Delight Sunrise port (ported_farmersdelight),
which carries Farmer's Delight Refabricated under MIT (see that mod's NOTICE).

No vanilla Minecraft assets are extracted or redistributed.
